# Towards Research Performance in the Humanities.

**Authors:** Moed, Henk F., Luwel, Marc, Nederhof, A. J.

## Abstract
Describes a methodology for developing bibliometric performance indicators which provide a framework or paradigm for application-oriented research in the field of evaluation quantitative science and technology studies, particularly in the humanities and social sciences. Aims at identifying characteristics of scholarly publications that reflect quality of a scholar or a scholarly work. (Author/JMK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ650928

